[[0,2026779,0,19,0,19,"2017-07-29T19:18:22","123_456","",[],"","One Part of a Micro Apartment in Hong Kong","https://imgoat.com/uploads/c383cd30b7/34031.jpg","merrygoround"],[1,9997224,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-29T19:46:22","vonHugenbuben","",[],"<p>Umm, no. I would lose my mind in such a small space.</p>"],[1,9997405,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-29T20:14:23","Helios-Apollo","",[],"<p>Poo in Foo.....d</p>"],[1,9997562,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-29T20:34:34","a11en","",[],"<p>I remember the story about this- that's a shared kitchen/bathroom space for the tenants of the micro apartments. (Ie this isn't one person's area!!)</p>"],[2,9997984,9997562,2,0,2,"2017-07-29T21:12:09","RoBatten","",[],"<p>Taking a shit in the kitchen right next to the food prep and stove . . . </p>"],[1,9997575,0,3,0,3,"2017-07-29T20:35:45","Mr_Wolf","[e]",[],"<p>I see you're showing one of their larger models. Why not post the human sized cage apartments. What were those sized at in the article? Six feet long by 2.5 feet wide/tall?</p>"],[2,9998702,9997575,0,0,0,"2017-07-29T22:28:26","tinyhousesbrah","",[],"<p>They got rid of the cages, this is the upgrade.</p>\n<p>Also: Tiny Houses!</p>"],[3,9998931,9998702,0,0,0,"2017-07-29T22:57:12","Mr_Wolf","[e]",[],"<p>The article that image came from still has boxed in cages. May not be chicken wire but theyre boxed in.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.nationalgeographic.com/photography/proof/2017/07/hong-kong-living-trapped-lam-photos/\">http://www.nationalgeographic.com/photography/proof/2017/07/hong-kong-living-trapped-lam-photos/</a></p>"],[4,9999207,9998931,0,0,0,"2017-07-29T23:34:11","tinyhousesbrah","",[],"<p>Yeah, think I misread. They're supposed to get an upgrade though.</p>"],[1,9997712,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-29T20:48:25","KikeFree","",[],"<p>Time to stop breeding. The mainland &quot;locusts&quot; figured it out.</p>"],[1,9998100,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-29T21:22:56","Titus-of-Voat","",[],"<p>At least close the lid Wtf. </p>\n<p>Seriously how can you shit in a food prep area. That's nasty. </p>"],[1,9999125,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-29T23:21:10","facepaint","",[],"<p>It appears that space was only intended to be a bathroom/shower combo. The washing machine &amp; kitchen were crammed in there. How on earth does that person bath without electrocuting themselves? I am kind of guessing the person doesn't shower, or just does a wipe down.</p>"]]
